{"headword":"עֶבְרָה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. overflow, arrogance, fury</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.9\">Is 13:9</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבְרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:18\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.18\">Zp 1:18</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶבְרָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.6\">Is 10:6</a> +, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲבָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:30\" href=\"/Job.21.30\">Jb 21:30</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:7\" href=\"/Psalms.7.7\">ψ 7:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:11\" href=\"/Job.40.11\">Jb 40:11</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>overflow, excess, outburst</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ זָדוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.24\">Pr 21:24</a> <em>excess of insolence;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַבְרוֹת אַפֶּ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:11\" href=\"/Job.40.11\">Jb 40:11</a> <em>outbursts of thine anger</em>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>arrogance</em>, of Moab <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.6\">Is 16:6</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּאוֹן</span>), hence <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.30\">Je 48:30</a> (+ id. v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.29\">29</a>)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>overflowing rage, fury:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of men, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:7\" href=\"/Genesis.49.7\">Gn 49:7</a> (poem in J), <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:11\" href=\"/Amos.1.11\">Am 1:11</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַף</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.6\">Is 14:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:35\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.35\">Pr 14:35</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁבֶט עֶבְרָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.8\">22:8</a> (i.e. rod wielded by him in fury, v. also <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:1\"